# Copy this file to .env in the repo root (cp .env.example .env) and paste your OpenRouter key below.
# .env is in .gitignore: never commit it. tools/run.py and tools/run_all.py load it at startup
# (harness/envfile.py); a variable already set in your shell wins over the file.
#
# Only the OpenRouter key goes here (decision D22):
# - The Anthropic key is NOT put here. It lives in OpenRouter's BYOK settings
#   (Settings > Integrations > Anthropic), set to "Never use shared capacity", so Claude Haiku 4.5
#   is billed to that Anthropic key and never falls back to OpenRouter's own capacity.
# - The OpenRouter account needs credits: meta-llama/llama-3.3-70b-instruct (and the qwen fallback)
#   are paid from them, and BYOK requests pay OpenRouter's small fee.
OPENROUTER_API_KEY=sk-or-v1-your-key-here
